// The prelude methods the native backends implement in Xo (decision
// 0074). internal/ssa lowers a prelude method `T.name` that it has no
// lowering of its own for to the function `T_name` here, whose first
// parameter is the receiver and whose type parameters are those of the
// declaration in std/prelude.xo, in order. Semantics are std/rt's.
use native/llrt/atomic
use native/llrt/cabi
use native/llrt/chan
use native/llrt/cpu
use native/llrt/cabi_c
use native/llrt/cabi_cbind
use native/llrt/cabi_libc
use native/llrt/cabi_wincrt
use native/llrt/cabi_nolibc
use native/llrt/cabi_poll
use native/llrt/cabi_race
use native/llrt/cabi_racefn
use native/llrt/cabi_inl
use native/llrt/cabi_tw
// os.net's runtime calls (rt.net_listen and the others, compiler/ssa
// exports.xo) lower to cabi_net's exports in every program that uses the
// network: imported here, not only through std/native/http (a program
// with os.net and no std/http linked only while every build loaded
// std/testing, 2026-10-27); its exports are built only for a program
// that makes a network call (ssa importer_built, uses_net)
use native/llrt/cabi_net
use native/llrt/netconn
use native/llrt/netwasi
use native/llrt/tasks
use native/llrt/fault
use native/llrt/ftoa
use native/llrt/fsops
use native/llrt/gomath
use native/llrt/host
use native/llrt/ifaces
use native/llrt/twflags
use native/llrt/fspath
use native/llrt/gen
use native/llrt/ints
use native/llrt/jsontext
use native/llrt/logstate
use native/llrt/num
use native/llrt/poll
use native/llrt/pool
use native/llrt/process
use native/llrt/proc
use native/llrt/procspec
use native/llrt/rand
use native/llrt/raw
use native/llrt/report
use native/llrt/scan
use native/llrt/procid
use native/llrt/sigsub
use native/llrt/stop
use native/llrt/selects
use native/llrt/show
use native/llrt/stdin as stdinrt
use native/llrt/stdio as stdiort
use native/llrt/strings
use native/llrt/sysio
use native/llrt/testworld
